message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Certifiable Search and Neutralization of Radio Emitters with Unknown Directionality"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, discrete-event simulator, experiment scripts and generated
  data for a certifiable search framework in which a bearing-only mobile sensor locates
  and neutralizes radio emitters of unknown directionality and proves that none remains.
